WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:36.940
So...

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.740
...I suppose I'll have to play
my trump card against you.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.570
Right...

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.200
Rose Bi...! What?!

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.670
This tactic is identical
to my own Bits Attack!

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:01.680
Oh, no!

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:06.140
Now, everyone.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.060
Today, another powerful
Gundam...

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.600
...has made an appearance.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:16.320
Neo Portugal
Jester Gundam

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.860
Yes. Neo Portugal's... Jester Gundam.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.320
And the Fighter, Romario Monini.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.110
Incredibly...

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.280
...in the battle...

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:21.410
...he fought with the
same techniques...

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.780
...as his opponent, Gundam Rose...

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.700
...and dealt an overwhelming blow...

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.000
...against George de Sand.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.870
This Fighter's next opponent is...

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.250
...Gundam Maxter.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:33.290
However...

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:36.700
...Chibodee was to fight an enemy
he could never have anticipated.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.510
Yes.
He was to fight against himself.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.090
And now!

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:46.760
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:52.810
Dazzling Power of the Clown!
Get Mad, Gundam Maxter!

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.950
You gotta be kidding!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.370
What good does it do,
coming to this place?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:13.790
Oh, man...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.080
I'm leaving now!

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:16.630
Wait!

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.820
You need to learn
about your opponent.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:20.800
That's right.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.090
You're up against
a Gundam called "Jester".

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.800
Apparently, the Fighter
works here as a clown.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.390
Well, I'm not interested.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.620
Chibodee!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:36.940
I'm impressed.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.570
Are you here to check up
on the enemy, too?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.440
Well, uh, you see...

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.030
Now, listen to this, Domon.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.370
Chibodee says he's not interested.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.030
He's trying to play hooky on us.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.740
Is that a good idea?

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.800
This Fighter was strong enough
to defeat George, right?

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.000
That's right!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.630
Bunny, you stay out of this!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:03:59.800
Hey!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.380
Let's hurry, okay?!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.300
Right.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.300
Now, Chibodee...

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.340
...let's be good boys
and check this out.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.620
Hey!

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.810
He's right.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.850
Hey! Hang on, Domon!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.350
Bunny, Cath, Shirley, Janet!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.100
Hey, Rain!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.980
Help me!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:30.330
That clown.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.500
He must be
Jester Gundam's Fighter.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.340
That was close!

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.350
A perfectly calculated move.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.230
Chibodee, are you feeling okay?

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.940
I-I'm fine.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.800
You copycat!
You trying to mock me?!

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:28.800
Interesting.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:29.970
Domon...

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.470
Hey, Domon.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:33.930
Now, what's next?

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.520
Start a fight here?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.160
That'll be fun.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.150
Let's see you copy me.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.860
He's just as fast as Domon.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.080
What?!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.580
This is your specialty technique,
isn't it?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.050
That's Domon's God Finger.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.010
No way. It's just a bluff.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.260
Erupting...

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.760
...God Finger!

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.820
Domon.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.080
Wh-what is that?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.540
You're next.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.220
Wh-what's so funny?!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.390
Stop it!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.510
Stop that laughing!

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:56.350
Chibodee?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.720
Stop it...

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:58.980
Stop it...

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.480
Stop it!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.150
Chibodee...

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.650
What's wrong with him?

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:15.830
Chibodee?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.290
Chibodee?!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.160
I wonder what's
wrong with Chibodee.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:23.830
He just hasn't been the same
since he saw that clown.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.250
Look, everyone.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.210
Something's weird.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.500
There's a problem with the data.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:29.760
What?

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:34.220
Somebody's been accessing
the data on Chibodee's past.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.010
Chibodee's past?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.260
Who'd want that?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:40.890
Chibodee...

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.230
Chibodee...

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.230
Wh-who's there?

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.650
It's me.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.160
It's Chibodee.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.620
What's wrong?
What're you afraid of?

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.620
Come on.
Your past is waiting for you.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.080
I got it!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.630
It's that Romario!

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:10.090
So, the clown's trying to dig up
facts on Chibodee's past?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.110
This place...

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:32.290
This place...

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.190
I know it...

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.920
Mommy! Wait, Mommy!
Don't go!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:46.960
Mommy!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.880
Mommy, no!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.680
Mommy!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.070
Mommy! Mommy!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.940
What happened to Mommy?!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.990
Stop it!
I can't stand that laughing!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.240
Stop it!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.490
Chibodee!

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.700
What's wrong?!

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.600
Mommy... Mommy...

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.670
Why, you!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:37.760
Bastard!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.590
Are you okay, Chibodee?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.300
Domon, what're you doing here?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.600
What am I doing here?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.190
What're you saying?

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.850
I'm here because your crew
asked me to come.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.820
I see.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:57.200
It's not my place to give advice...

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.320
...but this isn't like you.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.960
How could you let your opponent
mess with your mind?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.990
I know...

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.210
You're sweating badly.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.410
Don't touch me!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.220
Don't worry about me.

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:13.130
Leave me alone.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.380
He's not himself.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.180
Chibodee's haunted by his past.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:21.800
Huh?

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:22.970
According to his files...

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.930
...Chibodee was found crying
and alone in a...

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.020
...circus tent after a riot broke out.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.290
I thought maybe that
was the reason.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.820
Would it be possible for you
to examine him, Rain?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:40.360
That man can be quite obstinate.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.620
With us...
Well, you saw what happened.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.780
But since you're a doctor...

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.120
Oh, please.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.540
Please examine Chibodee.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.410
But, you see, I...

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.370
I'm going now.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:52.500
Domon...

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:55.000
This is your problem.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.630
It's for you to decide.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.970
You could use some
time away from Karato.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.270
Just what're you so afraid of,
Chibodee?!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.770
Come on! What happened to you?!

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.730
Get a grip!

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:19.530
Chibodee!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:40.010
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.260
You see.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.720
I told you he's worried.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:45.970
You really think so?

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:50.680
Then does that mean
Rain won't come back to Domon?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:53.480
Think about it. Chibodee's
popular with the girls.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.270
But that has nothing to do with it.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.770
Rain likes Domon,
you know.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:58.650
Oh, yeah?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.190
How would you know
how girls think?

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.240
So, is that a fact?

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:07.780
Then how about teaching me
a few things about how girls think?

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.410
It's past our bedtime!
Good night!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.830
Kids...

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:14.920
But, really...

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:18.920
...I sometimes wonder
what I'm doing here.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:27.700
I can't get that laugh
out of my head.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.600
You've been at it
for three hours straight.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.140
What're you doing here?

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:38.190
I want to know what you're
trying to get out of your system...

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.320
...along with all that sweat
you've worked up.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.070
It's none of your business.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:47.070
Did the girls put you up to this?

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:48.830
No.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.790
I was just concerned, as a doctor.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.720
As a doctor, huh?

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:55.500
Whatever.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.670
It might make me feel
better to talk about it.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.590
Well...

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.590
It all happened when I was five.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.020
Yeah, around that time I was
still living with my mom.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.890
Back then, New York was in
even more turmoil than it is now.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.730
People would start riots
for the few available tickets...

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.270
...that would take them
to the Colony.

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:27.240
My mom was finally able to get
tickets for us to get to the Colony.

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:28.570
That day...

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.200
...Mom took me to the circus to
celebrate our last day on Earth.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:33.700
That's when it happened.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.960
A gang demanded a shuttle...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.650
...and took the audience hostage.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.340
Mommy! Mommy!
Wait, Mommy! Don't go!

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:49.220
Mommy!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.600
Mommy!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.600
Mommy!

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.900
In the panic...

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.730
...I was taken hostage.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.780
Do you know how
frightening that was?

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:07.530
What about your mother?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.000
I just kept on hearing the gunshots.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.950
I can't imagine she's still alive.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.120
And every time I think
of my mom...

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.330
...I hear the voice of that guy
laughing at the boy...

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:19.580
...left all alone.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.380
Chibodee...

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.090
Such a pitiful story, huh?

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.920
It's okay. It's okay.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.600
Now that I've told you this,
I have a favor to ask.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.350
What?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.390
There's a song that my mom
used to sing to me.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:38.390
A song?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.860
We should just let Rain handle it.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.480
But I can't help it.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.320
How are those two doing?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.990
Not you too, Shirley.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.450
I hear something.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:53.970
Now...

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:55.580
Singing?

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.580
It's a song.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.580
Drifting above

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:05.090
A fleeting thought

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:13.010
Yes. You kind soul

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.430
Mommy.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.430
Your smile shines through

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:19.560
You'd like to believe your
mother's still alive, wouldn't you?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:19.560
Your smile shines through

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:27.730
Hanging onto one fragment
of hidden courage

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:37.330
That the people around you
don't even notice

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:41.020
Overflowing

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:53.680
Good morning.

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:55.720
Um...

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.180
Don't say a word.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.480
I'm okay.
You're the best doctor.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.190
Besides, I can't afford to lose now.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.900
Not in front of them.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.420
<i>Now, here at the</i>
<i>Queens Road East Ring</i>...

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:19.330
...<i>the starting time to tonight's</i>
<i>match is approaching</i>.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.460
Hey, look. There's Rain.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.410
Over there.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.270
But why won't she
come over to us?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.420
I wonder...

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.630
But this worries me!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:30.710
<i>Now!</i>

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.380
<i>First to appear in the ring</i>
<i>is Gundam Maxter</i>.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.590
<i>The Fighter, the man with the</i>
<i>burning fists, Chibodee Crocket!</i>

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:37.600
<i>And</i>...

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:39.970
What?

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.070
...<i>appearing on a tightrope</i>...

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.240
...<i>and riding a unicycle is</i>
<i>Jester Gundam!</i>

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:55.280
Trying to be funny, Mr. Clown?!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.660
<i>He's sure putting on a show!</i>

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.420
<i>This should be</i>
<i>an interesting match!</i>

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.920
I'll waste you in no time.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:09.920
Gundam Fight!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:11.630
Ready!

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:12.920
Go!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:16.880
Chibodee!

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.390
Hey, you think he'll be okay?

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.720
I don't know.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.560
Now that the Fight has started...

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.850
...there's nothing
we can do anymore.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.820
Trying to block my attacks
by hitting me head-on?

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:39.850
He's got the same moves
as Chibodee.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:40.700
Yes.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.580
I lost my match
to those same tactics...

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.500
It was as if I was
fighting against myself.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.710
How much longer do you plan
on mimicking me?

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.060
Shut up!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.400
What is this freak?!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:15.230
Stop laughing! Stop laughing!

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:18.240
Chibodee!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.950
No! You mustn't think about it!

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.220
But he's laughing.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.120
Just like back then...

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.030
He's laughing just like back then!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.420
Mommy!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.770
Mommy. It's scary to be alone.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.220
Mommy.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:55.440
Mommy...

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:56.690
Chibodee!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.900
Mommy... Mommy...!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.410
Oh, no.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.700
He's frightened again.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.030
If this keeps up...

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.620
But there's nothing we can do.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:08.500
Huh?

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:10.210
Please!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.250
You must sing that song!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.920
We know you were able to cheer
him up by singing that song.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.120
W-well, that's true, but...

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.760
Domon...

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.060
I'm with the Neo Japan crew.

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.400
From this point on...

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.940
...you've got to deal
with this yourselves.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.610
But what can we do?

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:45.370
Stay back...

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.700
Please stay back.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:48.870
Mommy...

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.250
The song!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.210
Mommy!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.840
Hanging onto a fragment
of hidden courage

00:19:55.840 --> 00:20:05.600
That the people around you
don't even notice

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:10.350
Overflowing...

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:16.110
With tears, I want to tell you

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.990
Shirley, Cath, Bunny, Janet...

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.150
I see it now.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.950
You've been there for me,
like my mother.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.950
Don't kid yourselves.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:29.080
I won't let you treat me
like a little...

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.870
...lonely boy!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:35.880
He dodged it!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:36.920
He stopped him!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.550
My punch is a lot
stronger than that!

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.180
No escape!

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:56.900
How dare you open up
an old wound of mine.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.110
You'll pay!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.200
Here I go!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.790
This is the true...

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.700
...Burning Punch!

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.270
What's the matter?

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.010
Why don't you try laughing again?

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:44.640
Chibodee has won his fight.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:50.070
I see the doctor's
special treatment worked!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:53.790
No. I just gave him
a temporary treatment.

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:56.790
I mean...

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.000
...he's got those four with him.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.710
Chibodee!

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.420
Okay!

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.340
I'm gonna win the championship,
for sure!

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:10.870
Especially for my
four "mommies"!

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:28.820
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:31.320
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:36.620
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:39.170
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:44.300
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:54.680
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.930 --> 00:23:02.230
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:06.780
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:10.360
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:17.830
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:26.670
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.680
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:40.940
Several Fighters are up to
no good as they hatch a plan.

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:44.980
Michelo Chariot is behind it all,
as revenge against Domon.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:45.730
Moreover...

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:47.980
...a terrifying mysterious
Gundam appears...

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:50.450
...and attacks Domon from the sky!

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:53.160
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:56.990
Dangerous trap! Neros Gundam strikes back.

00:23:54.870 --> 00:24:01.660
Dangerous Trap!
Neros Gundam Strikes Back

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.370
Ready! Go!
